int mirror = 0;
int temp = n;
while (temp > 0) {
    mirror = mirror * 10 + temp % 10;
    temp /= 10;
}
System.out.println(n + mirror);
```

What value is printed?

```java
int[][] grid = new int[4][4];
for (int i = 0; i < 4; i++) {
    for (int j = 0; j < 4; j++) {
        grid[i][j] = Math.abs(i - j);
    }
}
int sum = 0;
for (int[] row : grid) {
    for (int val : row) sum += val;
}
System.out.println(sum);
```

What value is printed?

```java
String s = "aababcabcd";
int maxRun = 0, run = 1;
for (int i = 1; i < s.length(); i++) {
    if (s.charAt(i) == s.charAt(i-1)) run++;
    else {
        maxRun = Math.max(maxRun, run);
        run = 1;
    }
}
maxRun = Math.max(maxRun, run);
System.out.println(maxRun);
```

